  "text": "Quick filters limit results to a kind of file in one click: Audio, Compressed, Document, Executable, Folder, Image and Video. Each one carries every extension Everything's own filter does, and more — 65 audio types, 79 video, 77 image, 86 document and 70 archive. You can also type them, with the aliases you would guess: audio: , video: , image: , document: , executable: and archive: , or music: , photos: , docs: and zip: . Source code is not filed under Document, unlike in Everything; ext:c;cpp;h brings that set back. To keep a search of your own as a filter, choose Search → Add to Filters… , and edit them with Organize Filters… ( Ctrl+Shift+O )."
